        "$\\int x\\,dx=\\frac{x^2}{2}$；$\\int\\frac{x}{x^2+1}\\,dx=\\frac{1}{2}\\ln(x^2+1)$。",
        "答案：$\\frac{x^2}{2}-\\frac{1}{2}\\ln(x^2+1)+C$。"
      ],
      "answer": "$\\frac{x^2}{2}-\\frac{1}{2}\\ln(x^2+1)+C$",
      "claim": "D(x^2/2-ln(x^2+1)/2) == x^3/(x^2+1)"
    }
